<section>
  <h2>What happens when you bring your bike in</h2>
  <p>
    When you arrive, our counter staff records your name, phone number,
    and your bike's make, model and serial number. We take a photo of
    the bike so there's never any confusion about its condition. Once a
    mechanic diagnoses the issue, we call you with a price and no work
    starts until you approve it.
